OL,3,CBorders Bowling Club loses home as
OL,4,Ccouncil plans to make it gymnastics
OL,5,Ccentre
OL,7,FMembers of Tweedbank Indoor Bowling
OL,8,FClub say they are devastated by the
OL,9,Fdecision to turn the building they've
OL,10,Fused for more than 40 years, into a
OL,11,Fgymnastics and soft play centre.
OL,13,FWe filmed with them ahead of the
OL,14,Fdecision to hear their thoughts and
OL,15,Fconcerns.
OL,17,FThey've now launched a petition to
OL,18,Fsave what they have called a 'vital
OL,19,Fcommunity facility."
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G1/8
