CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F323A1786745078
OL,3,CBorders Bowling Club loses home as
OL,4,Ccouncil plans to make it gymnastics
OL,5,Ccentre
OL,7,F"Tweedbank Indoor Bowling Club is not
OL,8,Fjust a sports venue, it is a lifeline
OL,9,Ffor many people across the Central
OL,10,FBorders," says President Malcolm Thin.
OL,12,F"It provides a safe, welcoming
OL,13,Fenvironment where individuals of all
OL,14,Fages, particularly our senior members
OL,15,Fcan stay active, socialise, and
OL,16,Fmaintain their mental wellbeing. Its
OL,17,Floss would leave a significant gap in
OL,18,Fcommunity provision and increase the
OL,19,Frisk of isolation for many.
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G2/8
OL,2,W/.!+.!/*%/.!+,*%/R(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext PageBBorder SportCReg RadioFRewind
FL,324,350,250,120,000,100
PN,32303
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F323A1786745078
OL,3,CBorders Bowling Club loses home as
OL,4,Ccouncil plans to make it gymnastics
OL,5,Ccentre
OL,7,F"This decision would end indoor
OL,8,Fbowling in the Central Borders. For a
OL,9,Fregion with a strong bowling
OL,10,Ftradition, this would be a devastating
OL,11,Fblow."
OL,13,FThe property is operated by Live
OL,14,FBorders which is making a number of
OL,15,Fchanges to the services it delivers in
OL,16,Forder to maximise usage and income,
OL,17,Ffollowing years of financial
OL,18,Fdifficulties.
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G3/8
OL,2,W/.!+.!/*%/.!+,*%/R(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext PageBBorder SportCReg RadioFRewind
