PN,32304
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F323A1786745078
OL,3,CBorders Bowling Club loses home as
OL,4,Ccouncil plans to make it gymnastics
OL,5,Ccentre
OL,7,FAt a full meeting of Scottish Borders
OL,8,FCouncil on Thursday 21 May,
OL,9,Fcouncillors accepted recommendations
OL,10,Fto spend half a million pounds
OL,11,Ftransforming the building into a
OL,12,Fgymnastics and soft play centre.
OL,14,FPlans which are predicted to bring in
OL,15,F#150,000 of income annually by 2031/32.
OL,17,FThe council report states: "The
OL,18,Fdevelopment of the bowling hall into a
OL,19,Ffamily-oriented centre would help
OL,20,Frejuvenate the wider site.
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G4/8
OL,2,W/.!+.!/*%/.!+,*%/R(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext PageBBorder SportCReg RadioFRewind
FL,324,350,250,120,000,100
PN,32305
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F323A1786745078
OL,3,CBorders Bowling Club loses home as
OL,4,Ccouncil plans to make it gymnastics
OL,5,Ccentre
OL,7,F"An extensive adventure play facility
OL,8,Fcould be built alongside gymnastics
OL,9,Fwithin the bowling hall, which is too
OL,10,Flarge for gymnastics alone. Dance and
OL,11,Fteen fitness can also take place on
OL,12,Fadditional floor space and in the
OL,13,Fstudio area. Children's parties will
OL,14,Fbe a significant source of income."
OL,16,FIt says this would generate
OL,17,F"significantly more footfall and
OL,18,Fimpact than indoor bowling, which is
OL,19,Fonly played for five months of the
OL,20,Fyear, and membership has reduced to
OL,21,Funder 100."
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G5/8
OL,2,W/.!+.!/*%/.!+,*%/R(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext PageBBorder SportCReg RadioFRewind
FL,324,350,250,120,000,100
PN,32306
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F323A1786745078
OL,3,CBorders Bowling Club loses home as
OL,4,Ccouncil plans to make it gymnastics
OL,5,Ccentre
OL,7,FIt added that work could start as
OL,8,Fearly as January 2027.
OL,10,FIn November 2025, Scottish Borders
OL,11,FCouncil agreed to a range of measures
OL,12,Fdesigned to deliver combined annual
OL,13,Fsavings and increased income of #2.2m
OL,14,Ffor the charitable body Live Borders,
OL,15,Fwho runs sporting, cultural, and
OL,16,Fleisure facilities on its behalf.
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G6/8
OL,2,W/.!+.!/*%/.!+,*%/R(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
