PN,32307
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F323A1786745078
OL,3,CBorders Bowling Club loses home as
OL,4,Ccouncil plans to make it gymnastics
OL,5,Ccentre
OL,7,FThis followed an independent report
OL,8,Fpublished in April 2025, which
OL,9,Frecommended the closure of a number of
OL,10,Fbuildings in order to save the
OL,11,Forganisation money and help sustain
OL,12,Fits future.
OL,14,FThe bowling club is now asking Live
OL,15,FBorders and Scottish Borders Council
OL,16,Fto 'work with them' to find a solution
OL,17,Fthat allows bowling to continue
OL,18,Falongside any future developments.
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G7/8
